<title>UK: William Cook shares suspended.</title>
<headline>William Cook shares suspended.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>British steel castings group William Cook Plc said on Thursday that trading in its shares have been temporarily suspended pending an announcement.</p>
<p>Prior to the suspension its shares were trading at 380p, up five pence on the day.</p>
</text>
